<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'PingFang SC' }}>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 64, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 21, fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>知迹 · 答辩汇报</Text>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 1010, top: 21, width: 194, textAlign: 'right', fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF' }}>赛道十三 · 智慧教育</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 96, width: 1128 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>八个模块，决定它是系统还是原型</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>这些不是"有更好"，而是"缺一项就不算能交付的工程系统"</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 196, width: 296, height: 458, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>工程完整度</Text>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 12 }}>
      缺一项，\n就退回原型
    </Text>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 12 }}>
      只做一个能跑的对话循环，半天就够；难的是让它出错时不炸、花钱有上限、变差了能发现。下面八项各自解决一个问题。
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 20, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, gap: 8 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>全部八项都有对应测试</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>共 279 项，离线可跑</Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 412, top: 196, width: 380, height: 458, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 106 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>01</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>输入输出护栏</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>输入拦越界与提示词注入，输出拦空回答与系统提示词泄漏。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 106, marginTop: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>02</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>工具超时与重试</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>单次超时；只对可重试错误做有限退避，失败转成工具消息而不炸回合。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 106, marginTop: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>03</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>上下文压缩</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>历史过长时从整轮边界裁剪，绝不拆散"调用—结果"的配对。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 106, marginTop: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>04</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>模型路由与预算</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>按意图与复杂度选档；token 记账，当日超预算直接阻止真实调用。</Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 828, top: 196, width: 380, height: 458, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 106 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>05</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>MCP 客户端</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>自写 stdio JSON-RPC，能启动外部 server、发现工具并注册进工具表。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 106, marginTop: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>06</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>检查点与续跑</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>会话可断点续跑；它同时也是"写操作先暂停"能成立的前提。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 106, marginTop: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>07</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>回合诊断</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>每个回合留 trace，失败可归因到路由、检索、工具还是生成。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 106, marginTop: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>08</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>评测门禁</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>两份考卷 + 基线；改完重跑，掉出容差即返回非零，拦住提交。</Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, bottom: 24, width: 1128, height: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>知迹 · 基于大模型智能体的 AI 教育学习系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>08 / 10</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
